INTRO:

Hello everyone, this is an English translation patch for Uzumaki Noroi Simulation.

All dialogue, 99% of the UI, and most graphical text is translated into English.  

The game is fully completable in English.  Enjoy!

This is my very first English translation ROM patch.  If it sucks, now you know why.  

HOW TO USE:

If you use an emulator with soft patching capabilities, simply put the IPS file into the same directory as the ROM and
change the filename to match them, or use your favorite IPS patcher. 
 
Required clean-ROM SHA-256:
`cb726ea64e6d189835af81aab5339a8713cf749adc4cee119d6680975de5c316`

NOTE: I do not know if this patch works with the [f1] PROM-to-SRAM compatibility ROM.  Testing was done with [M][!] version.

F.A.Q.

1. What exactly remains untranslated?
1A. The title screen text, the intro Raise a Snail graphic, and the "choose your name" UI of the raise a snail minigame, 
and a small amount of text in graphical cutaways. However, if you choose "おまかせ" on the name selection screen it will give you 
a random snail name with Latin characters.

2. Why didn't you translate the above?
2A. Too hard/don't know how/aesthetic reasons :)

3. Did you use AI?
3A. Yes, for help finding/editing memory/opcodes, and the translation, with is MTL with Human review and editing.

